msgid "ReliefNT 5.1.2"
msgstr "ReliefNT 5.1.2"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid "启动、存储与文件系统"
msgstr "Boot, Storage, and Filesystems"

msgid ""
"增加 **Legacy BIOS Multiboot2** 保护模式入口：检查 CPU 特性，建立页表与栈后进入共享 64 位内核。BIOS/EFI 交接解析检查边界、对齐和溢出，保留 EFI "
"信息指针完整宽度，失败不发布部分结果。"
msgstr ""
"Added a **Legacy BIOS Multiboot2** protected-mode entry that checks CPU features, builds page "
"tables and a stack, and enters the shared 64-bit kernel. BIOS/EFI handoff parsing checks bounds, "
"alignment, and overflow, retains full-width EFI pointers, and publishes no partial results on "
"failure."

msgid "增加 **GPT PARTUUID 根分区选择**，在设备发现后解析显式身份；缺失、畸形或重复身份拒绝自动回退到其他磁盘。"
msgstr ""
"Added **GPT PARTUUID root partition selection**, resolving explicit identity after device "
"discovery. Missing, malformed, or duplicate identities reject automatic fallback to other disks."

msgid ""
"修正 Linux ``BLKROGET`` ioctl 编码，消除内核私有 timerfd/eventfd 标志与 ``O_SYNC``/``O_TMPFILE`` "
"的冲突；同步写入完成实际刷新并传播错误。独占块设备打开正确识别已挂载分区，避免匿名光盘/RAM 挂载误占其他磁盘。"
msgstr ""
"Corrected Linux ``BLKROGET`` ioctl encoding and removed conflicts between private timerfd/eventfd "
"flags and ``O_SYNC``/``O_TMPFILE``. Synchronous writes perform actual flushing and propagate "
"errors. Exclusive block opens correctly identify mounted partitions without letting anonymous "
"optical/RAM mounts falsely occupy other disks."

msgid ""
"块写入按打开时的 DAC、描述符访问模式授权，移除旧桌面角色门槛；``O_PATH`` 不能写入，``BLKRRPART`` 重读分区表要求 Linux ``CAP_SYS_ADMIN``。"
msgstr ""
"Block writes are authorized by open-time DAC and descriptor access mode, removing the old desktop-"
"role requirement. ``O_PATH`` cannot write; partition-table rereads with ``BLKRRPART`` require "
"Linux ``CAP_SYS_ADMIN``."

msgid "FAT 目录改为按需有界分配，解除旧每目录 64 项限制；修正未对齐 UTF-16 长文件名读取及目录扩展的尾部标记，保留原有磁盘格式与元数据校验。"
msgstr ""
"FAT directories now allocate on demand with bounded allocations, removing the old 64-entry-per-"
"directory limit. Fixed unaligned UTF-16 long-filename reads and end markers during directory "
"expansion, preserving disk format and metadata checks."

msgid "Linux 系统调用、调度与性能"
msgstr "Linux Syscalls, Scheduling, and Performance"

msgid ""
"``execve``/``execveat`` 按 Linux x86_64 "
"的软栈限制计算参数总预算，动态保存参数与环境，检查单串和指针开销。新映像、参数和初始栈准备成功后才提交，失败保留旧进程状态；fork、exec 和退出按实际所有权管理参数副本。"
msgstr ""
"``execve``/``execveat`` calculate total argument budgets from Linux x86_64 soft stack limits, "
"dynamically store arguments/environment, and check individual strings and pointer overhead. Commit"
" only after the new image, arguments, and initial stack are ready, preserving old process state on"
" failure; fork, exec, and exit manage argument copies by actual ownership."

msgid ""
"初始用户栈按实际布局增长，保留 ``RLIMIT_STACK``、``RLIMIT_AS`` 与不可执行页面检查。支持 ``utimensat(fd, NULL, times, "
"0)``，文件在改名或 unlink 后仍按描述符引用的 inode 更新，拒绝 ``O_PATH``。"
msgstr ""
"The initial user stack grows to fit its actual layout, retaining ``RLIMIT_STACK``, ``RLIMIT_AS``, "
"and non-executable-page checks. Added ``utimensat(fd, NULL, times, 0)``, updating the descriptor-"
"held inode even after rename or unlink and rejecting ``O_PATH``."

msgid ""
"副核使用 ACPI PM 时钟校准 LAPIC 抢占定时器；各核 busy/idle 与任务 CPU 时间改按统一 USER_HZ "
"时钟结算，避免统计随副核中断频率变化。校准失败记录原因并保留回退。"
msgstr ""
"Secondary CPUs calibrate LAPIC preemption timers with the ACPI PM clock. Per-CPU busy/idle and "
"task CPU time now use a common USER_HZ clock so statistics do not vary with secondary-CPU "
"interrupt rates. Calibration failure records its reason and retains fallback."

msgid "在已有执行事务内完成符合条件的 syscall 返回，内部停驻期间保留 ``pselect`` 临时信号掩码；允许仍被映射或引用的文件页超出空闲缓存预算，同时保持共享映射一致性。"
msgstr ""
"Complete eligible syscall returns within existing execution transactions, preserving ``pselect`` "
"temporary signal masks during internal parking. Allow file pages still mapped or referenced to "
"exceed idle-cache budgets while preserving shared-mapping consistency."

msgid ""
"``readv``/``writev`` 直接调用共享标量读写后端，避免递归进入大分发栈帧，保留校验、部分结果、偏移和等待重试语义。DRM 资源退休与 exec "
"维护增加保守的空队列提示，减少无工作时的锁开销。"
msgstr ""
"``readv``/``writev`` call shared scalar I/O backends directly instead of recursively entering "
"large dispatch frames, retaining validation, partial results, offsets, and wait/retry semantics. "
"Conservative empty-queue hints in DRM resource retirement and exec maintenance reduce locking when"
" no work exists."

msgid "控制台与诊断"
msgstr "Console and Diagnostics"

msgid ""
"在内核只读数据中内置 ReliefOS 启动图标，按发现的逻辑 CPU 数量在 framebuffer 顶部绘制，自动留距、换行或缩放；保留文本行，用户态启动前移除图标并恢复完整控制台。"
msgstr ""
"Embedded ReliefOS boot icons in kernel read-only data. The framebuffer top displays one per "
"detected logical CPU, with automatic spacing, wrapping, or scaling. Text lines remain available; "
"before userspace starts, icons are removed and the full console restored."

msgid ""
"Kernel panic 改为醒目的文字诊断：在当前文本 VT 输出；GUI "
"中从左上角绘制，仅文字字符格覆盖黑底，保留其余桌面像素。输出异常、寄存器、CPU/任务、内核版本和构建身份，并保留串口诊断。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel panic now uses prominent text diagnostics in the current text VT. In GUI mode, text starts "
"at the top-left, covering only character cells with black and preserving other desktop pixels. "
"Output includes exceptions, registers, CPU/task, kernel version, and build identity, with serial "
"diagnostics retained."

msgid "紧急输出以有界 NMI 等待停止其他在线 CPU，绕过普通控制台/显卡锁和动态分配；图形区域写满后停止绘制，完整诊断仍写入串口和 VT 历史。"
msgstr ""
"Emergency output stops other online CPUs with bounded NMI waits, bypassing ordinary "
"console/graphics locks and dynamic allocation. Drawing stops when the graphics area fills; "
"complete diagnostics still enter serial output and VT history."

msgid "构建与源码组织"
msgstr "Build and Source Organization"

msgid "内核、vDSO、宿主工具与头文件导出改用固定的 **Linux 6.12 Kbuild/Kconfig**，保留公开产物名称，移除旧构建与配置前端。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel, vDSO, host tools, and header exports now use pinned **Linux 6.12 Kbuild/Kconfig**, "
"preserving public artifact names and removing old build/configuration frontends."

msgid ""
"将混合职责的大文件拆分到架构、调度、系统调用、内存、块层、文件系统、网络、驱动及声音等目录。各代码目录的 Kbuild 只列本地对象和直接子目录，生产源文件独立编译；这不引入可加载模块。"
msgstr ""
"Split large mixed-responsibility files into architecture, scheduling, syscall, memory, block, "
"filesystem, network, driver, and sound directories. Each code directory's Kbuild lists only local "
"objects and immediate subdirectories, with production sources compiled separately; this does not "
"introduce loadable modules."

msgid "明确公开 UAPI 与私有头文件边界，增加源码迁移映射、本地 Kbuild/对象覆盖和上游引擎摘要检查；恢复曾被忽略规则排除的页缓存源码，并增加 CI 构建输入审计。"
msgstr ""
"Clarified public UAPI/private-header boundaries; added source migration maps, local Kbuild/object "
"coverage, and upstream engine digest checks. Restored page-cache sources previously excluded by "
"ignore rules and added CI build-input auditing."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking Changes"

msgid "**是，涉及纠正后的 ioctl、管理权限与内部构建接口。**"
msgstr "**Yes: corrected ioctls, administrative permissions, and internal build interfaces.**"

msgid ""
"``BLKROGET`` 从错误的 ``_IOR(0x12, 94, int)`` 改为 Linux 规定的 ``_IO(0x12, 94)``。使用旧 ReliefNT "
"头编译并固化旧请求值的工具需以当前 UAPI 重编译。"
msgstr ""
"``BLKROGET`` changed from incorrect ``_IOR(0x12, 94, int)`` to Linux-defined ``_IO(0x12, 94)``. "
"Tools compiled with old ReliefNT headers and fixed request values require rebuilding with current "
"UAPI."

msgid "块设备访问依赖文件权限、有效描述符和相应 Linux capability；依赖已退休桌面角色授权，或在没有 ``CAP_SYS_ADMIN`` 时重读分区表的程序需调整。"
msgstr ""
"Block access depends on file permissions, valid descriptors, and relevant Linux capabilities. "
"Programs relying on retired desktop-role authorization or rereading partition tables without "
"``CAP_SYS_ADMIN`` need adjustment."

msgid "内核私有头、旧单文件源码路径、旧配置前端及自研构建规则已迁移或删除。外部源码补丁、白盒测试和内部结构消费者需按新目录调整；私有符号不构成稳定 ABI。"
msgstr ""
"Private kernel headers, old single-file source paths, configuration frontends, and custom build "
"rules moved or were deleted. External patches, white-box tests, and internal-structure consumers "
"must follow new directories; private symbols are not stable ABI."

msgid "本版不是完整 ABI 认证。既有驱动接口 golden 为 168 字节、实际结构为 296 字节的问题仍保留，没有通过重生成 golden 掩盖差异。"
msgstr ""
"This is not complete ABI certification. The existing driver-interface golden remains 168 bytes "
"against an actual 296-byte structure; differences have not been concealed by regenerating golden "
"data."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and Migration Notes"

msgid "本次为 **源码 Release**，不提供预编译内核。使用标签源码、锁定依赖和实际配置重新构建，保持 ``kernel.sys``、调试符号、导出 UAPI 与配套用户态一致。"
msgstr ""
"This **source Release** provides no precompiled kernel. Rebuild using tagged source, pinned "
"dependencies, and actual configuration, keeping ``kernel.sys``, debug symbols, exported UAPI, and "
"accompanying userspace aligned."

msgid ""
"使用新的 ``O`` 目录和 Kconfig 配置验证迁移，内部路径参照 `模块说明 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/blob/v5.1.2/docs/KERNEL_MODULES.md>`_。产物仍由父仓通过安装清单消费。"
msgstr ""
"Validate migration with a new ``O`` directory and Kconfig configuration; see `module notes "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/blob/v5.1.2/docs/KERNEL_MODULES.md>`_ for internal "
"paths. The parent still consumes artifacts through installation manifests."

msgid ""
"BIOS 入口需要支持相应 CPU 特性的机器与正确的 Multiboot2 引导器；本仓不负责生成 ReliefOS ISO 或安装引导器。显式 PARTUUID 必须唯一且对应目标 GPT "
"root，旧内核回滚不能假定支持新菜单。"
msgstr ""
"The BIOS entry requires appropriate CPU features and a correct Multiboot2 bootloader. This "
"repository neither generates ReliefOS ISOs nor installs bootloaders. Explicit PARTUUID must be "
"unique and identify the target GPT root; rollback to old kernels must not assume support for new "
"menus."

msgid "更新 SDK 和使用块 ioctl 的程序，核对设备 DAC 与 capability 策略。FAT 改动没有改变磁盘格式，仍需在更新或操作分区前备份数据。"
msgstr ""
"Update the SDK and block-ioctl consumers, and check device DAC/capability policies. FAT changes "
"preserve disk format; still back up data before updating or operating on partitions."

msgid "已有分项 QEMU 启动、安装配套和系统调用验证不等于本标签的整版迁移认证。**VMware 验证未完成**，物理硬件未验证；编译压力下桌面交互、长期运行和全部恢复场景仍未完成验收。"
msgstr ""
"Existing partial QEMU boot, installer integration, and syscall checks do not constitute full "
"migration certification for this tag. **VMware validation is incomplete** and physical hardware "
"unvalidated. Desktop interaction under compilation load, long runs, and all recovery scenarios "
"remain unaccepted."

msgid "保留现有高地址 PCI MMIO 限制：默认 OVMF 的某些 NVMe BAR 超出 direct map 范围时，设备不能初始化。不能把低地址布局中的成功推广到所有硬件拓扑。"
msgstr ""
"Existing high-address PCI MMIO limits remain: some NVMe BARs under default OVMF exceed the direct "
"map and cannot initialize. Success with low-address layouts cannot be generalized to all hardware "
"topologies."

msgid "驱动 ABI golden、部分旧测试 fixture 及完整自举仍有已知未完成项；未改变 golden 或既有音频策略，不宣称总测试或全部 Linux/POSIX 一致性检查通过。"
msgstr ""
"Driver ABI golden, some old test fixtures, and full self-hosting still have known unfinished "
"items. Golden data and existing audio policy remain unchanged; no claim is made that the overall "
"suite or all Linux/POSIX conformance checks pass."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer Notes"

msgid "基础版本为 ``5.1.2``，生成的数字字段为 ``5/1/2``；``EXTRAVERSION`` 与 ``LOCALVERSION`` 继续独立追加，并保留字符和长度校验。"
msgstr ""
"The base version is ``5.1.2``, generating numeric fields ``5/1/2``. ``EXTRAVERSION`` and "
"``LOCALVERSION`` remain separately appended with character and length validation."

msgid ""
"使用根 GNU Make 入口、各级 Kbuild 和仓库工具链配置；需 GNU Make 4.3 或更新版本。新增源文件必须登记到所属目录 Kbuild，公开头仍通过 "
"``headers_install`` 白名单导出。"
msgstr ""
"Use root GNU Make, per-directory Kbuild, and repository toolchain configuration; GNU Make 4.3 or "
"newer is required. Register new source files in their directory's Kbuild. Public headers still use"
" the ``headers_install`` allowlist."

msgid ""
"``make test-module-layout`` 检查模块边界、源码覆盖及引擎摘要；启动解析、徽标、panic、vDSO 和头导出各有独立测试。宿主夹具、内核编译与来宾运行须分开报告，配套 "
"ReliefOS 的测试工具不算作本仓源码交付。"
msgstr ""
"``make test-module-layout`` checks module boundaries, source coverage, and engine digests. Boot "
"parsing, logo, panic, vDSO, and header exports have independent tests. Report host fixtures, "
"kernel compilation, and guest runs separately; accompanying ReliefOS test tools are not source "
"deliverables of this repository."

msgid ""
"默认 8 MiB 软栈限制下 exec 参数预算为 2 MiB；总预算最低 128 KiB、最高 6 MiB，单串最多 128 KiB（含 NUL），另计指针等开销。细节见 `exec 参数契约 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/blob/v5.1.2/docs/EXEC_ARGUMENTS.md>`_。"
msgstr ""
"With the default 8 MiB soft stack limit, the exec argument budget is 2 MiB. Total budget ranges "
"from 128 KiB to 6 MiB, with a 128 KiB per-string limit including NUL, plus pointer and other "
"overhead. See the `exec argument contract "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/blob/v5.1.2/docs/EXEC_ARGUMENTS.md>`_."

msgid "CPU 时间精度仍为 10 ms，本次校准不代表完整的用户/内核/子进程时间拆分。吞吐和锁开销改进受负载与虚拟机条件影响，没有达到或承诺统一的 5 GB/s 指标。"
msgstr ""
"CPU time still has 10 ms precision; calibration does not imply complete user/kernel/child-process "
"time separation. Throughput and locking improvements depend on workload and VM conditions; no "
"uniform 5 GB/s target was reached or promised."

msgid ""
"本说明覆盖内核 5.1.1 版本提交 ``d561d4c8b296153723677c6b63497eb8867d024d`` "
"之后至本标签的有效变更，不包含主仓应用、桌面或镜像打包。下一版以本次版本提交为区间起点。"
msgstr ""
"These notes cover effective changes after the 5.1.1 kernel version commit "
"``d561d4c8b296153723677c6b63497eb8867d024d`` through this tag, excluding main-repository "
"applications, desktop, and image packaging. The next version starts its interval at this version "
"commit."
